OL,3,GNEWSAFourth person charged after attack
OL,4,Aon ship crew
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fourth person has been charged
OL,7,Ffollowing an attack on ship workers
OL,8,Fnear Avonmouth Docks.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said three
OL,11,Fmen, all from the Philippines, were
OL,12,Fassaulted on 31 July during an attack
OL,13,Finvolving a large group of people at
OL,14,FRichmond Terrace, Avonmouth, near
OL,15,FBristol.
OL,17,FTwo workers needed hospital treatment
OL,18,Fas a result of injuries sustained
OL,19,Fduring the attack and, while one has
OL,20,Fbeen sent home, another remains
OL,21,Fseriously ill in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
