OL,3,GNEWSAFourth person charged after attack
OL,4,Aon ship crew
OL,5,
OL,6,FKayleigh Coates, 39, from north
OL,7,FBristol, has been charged with two
OL,8,Fcounts of assault causing grievous
OL,9,Fbodily harm (GBH) and a
OL,10,Fracially-aggravated public order
OL,11,Foffence. She was released on
OL,12,Fconditional bail and is due to appear
OL,13,Fin court on 22 October.
